{"chars": "The runes on Blitzen's antlers grew brighter and brighter, until they lifted away into the sky like sparks from a fire. They spun and drifted and found their places, one after another: Wait at the center, then Balance, then Listen, then Belong, then Hope, and Gratitude at the very tip, all lined up along a single shining arm. And then the arm was mirrored, and then there were two arms, and then three, and four, and five, and six.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.713, 0.713, 0.713, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 0.85, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.363, 1.85, 1.85, 1.85, 1.85, 1.85, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.05, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.45, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 2.575, 3.275, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.638, 3.638, 3.638, 3.638, 3.638, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 3.775, 4.1, 4.1, 4.1, 4.1, 4.1, 4.438, 4.438, 4.438, 4.438, 4.438, 4.638, 4.638, 4.638, 4.638, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 4.737, 5.125, 5.125, 5.125, 5.125, 5.125, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.362, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.8, 5.938, 5.938, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.925, 7.05, 7.05, 7.05, 7.05, 7.05, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 7.725, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.088, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 8.2, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 8.575, 9.1, 9.175, 9.175, 9.175, 9.175, 9.363, 9.363, 9.363, 9.363, 9.363, 9.363, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 9.65, 10.275, 10.375, 10.375, 10.375, 10.375, 10.375, 10.613, 10.613, 10.613, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.688, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 10.787, 11.375, 11.475, 11.475, 11.475, 11.475, 11.475, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 11.675, 12.25, 12.325, 12.325, 12.325, 12.325, 12.325, 12.55, 12.55, 12.55, 12.55, 12.55, 12.5